  letterName: Ruzica Letter
  recipient: 
  signoff: 
  textParts:
  - ' '
  - "\n\nI\u2019m sure you\u2019re wondering where I\u2019ve gone. You all probably
    aren\u2019t surprised. The truth is, I\u2019ve left to live the rest of my life
    with my one, true love. He loves me and he makes me happy.  "
  - ', but I never could have stayed. You  '
  - ' between me and '
  - ' so I made the choice for you. I refuse to spend my life hiding the person who
    makes me happy because '
  - ". I don\u2019t even want to think about what you all would have done to him
    if you had found out before all this.\n\n"
  - " I will not be coming back. Please don\u2019t waste your time looking for me.
    Please don\u2019t try to convince me to change my mind. I am right where I need
    and want to be. I hope that maybe one day you will change your mind about the
    Thebrean people and to stop "
  - ". We all need to focus on moving forward.\n\n "
  - ",\nRuzica\n "
